Put environment variables, system properties, and other test-code setup in `agent_guidance`. Do not restate deterministic entries as guidance.

Return a single JSON object with this shape:
{
  "action": "no_action" | "advisory_preparation",
  "summary": "short reason",
  "deterministic_setup": [ ... dependency or docker_image entries, if any ... ],
